    dialoguetext: ...You!?
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: You.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: You watched when that psychopath put me in the hospital.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: You had the bearing of a pup then.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'What are you doing in my building?

      Did you mess with my
      family?'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: Could you even do anything about it if I did?
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: ...
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: You seem ready to bear up now. Ha!
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: WHAT DO YOU WANT, OLD MAN!?
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: My name is Graeber, and I have a proposition for you.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'And like any good opportunity, it will only be available once.

'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 2108973030}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: ' Liam, is everything OK, who are you talking to down there?

'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: ... It's just Top, band business. I'll be right up.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: Your family deserves better.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: "And you think you get a say in what I do and don\u2019t deserve..."
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'I''m a judge of these things.

'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'Yeah? With whatever spare time you have

      not hanging with
      drug dealers?'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: "Worry less about me, and more about whats \nbest for your family\r\n"
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'Like $1000 SMAMS. No strings attached.

'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: Do I look that stupid? Be serious.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'Be serious? Speak for yourself, cub. '
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'If I wanted you hurt or in pain, the easiest thing I could

      do
      is leave you to your own devices, right now.'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: 'Tomorrow. Outside Five bar. Listen to what I have to offer.

'
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: "Afterwards, you can choose to continue with whatever \nlife you
      have left, and I'll wish you luck.\nBut if you do, you will doing it 1000 $MAMS
      richer."
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 123073695}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: I'll think about it. Whatever.
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  - actorGameObject: {fileID: 1795666628}
    actorName: 
    dialoguetext: ...Ha!
    dialogueGameObject: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueLaunched: 0
  isLoopedDialogue: 0
